.env
AGENTS.md

# impeccable writes these into the repository root and documents no way to move
# them. The design truth lives in the vault, so both names are symlinks into it and
# neither is committed — one file, owned by the vault, invisible to a public repo.
PRODUCT.md
DESIGN.md
